{"name":"Shylock","hex":"#5ab9a4","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Shylock","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A moneylender (Jewish stereotype) in Shakespeare's Merchant of Venice."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Alternative letter-case form of shylock."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Shylock"}],"entries":[{"title":"Shylock","blocks":[{"text":"Shylock is a fictional character in William Shakespeare's play The Merchant of Venice. A Venetian Jewish moneylender, Shylock is the play's principal villain. His defeat and forced conversion to Christianity form the climax of the story."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1b/Ernst_von_Possart_as_Shylock.jpg/330px-Ernst_von_Possart_as_Shylock.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shylock"},{"title":"Shylock (2020 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Shylock is a 2020 Indian Malayalam-language masala film directed by Ajay Vasudev, written by Aneesh Hameed-Bibin Mohan and produced by Joby George Thadathil under Goodwill Entertainments. The film stars Mammootty in titular role, alongside and Rajkiran, Meena, Siddique, Kalabhavan Shajon, Baiju Santhosh, Bibin George and Hareesh Kanaran in supporting roles. The film's title is a slang term for a loan shark. The music was composed by Gopi Sundar, while cinematography and editing were handled by Renadive and Riyas K. Badhar."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/bf/Shylock_2020_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shylock_(2020_film)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Charles_Macklin_as_Shylock%2C_c._1768_by_Johann_Zoffany.png/500px-Charles_Macklin_as_Shylock%2C_c._1768_by_Johann_Zoffany.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thu